    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about the Strane brand and what they offer such as Flower, Disposables, Vaporizers, Pre-Rolls!</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Strane</strong> – Strane can be found in so many places and form factors and it all starts with the unique cultivars cannabis customers and budtenders love. Nature and nurture, Strane showcases our skill at growing craft cannabis at scale.</li></ul><p><img alt=\"Alien Mints image 0\" width=\"240\" height=\"230\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/f0ba8fa19e07745f3b4afbb1f325df19?auto=format&amp;fit=fill&amp;fill=solid&amp;ixlib=react-9.5.4&amp;h=330&amp;w=344\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"> <img alt=\"Grandaddy Purps | Disposable image 0\" width=\"242\" height=\"233\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/65cd5eacddc198f32a209fcb3f4fbf71?auto=format&amp;fit=fill&amp;fill=solid&amp;ixlib=react-9.5.4&amp;h=330&amp;w=344\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"> <img alt=\"Super Gremlin | Live Resin Terps image 0\" width=\"242\" height=\"232\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/5ac561bf1f969627297d495e40b100c5?auto=format&amp;fit=fill&amp;fill=solid&amp;ixlib=react-9.5.4&amp;h=330&amp;w=344\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"> <img alt=\"Gas Cake | 10pk | 0.5g image 0\" width=\"228\" height=\"219\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://images.dutchie.com/7c429ec8c17803d2bd6d04b2fd17e2de?auto=format&amp;fit=fill&amp;fill=solid&amp;ixlib=react-9.5.4&amp;h=330&amp;w=344\" data-missing=\"not-inventoried\"></p><p><strong><a href=\"/brands/strane/\">Click here to shop Strane products!</a></strong></p>"
    },
